00:10:40.839 --> 00:10:45.760
obvious to me that I can't compete with

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:47.280
WhisperFlow and all of those guys. But,

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:49.760
WhisperFlow and those people, they don't

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:51.560
want to go after the senior market. They

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:53.520
just don't do it, and it's not as sexy,

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:55.839
I suppose. Like, there's this quote that

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:58.240
says like, "Don't sell vitamins, sell

00:10:55.839 --> 00:11:00.040
painkillers." I think dictation tools to

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:01.760
you and me are vitamins. They make us a

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:03.880
little bit better. But, to the people

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:06.120
that I'm serving, it's a painkiller.

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:07.680
Like, they need that product to work.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:09.160
>> That's really smart. And I think that's

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:10.720
real secret sauce there, too, of like

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:12.440
when you're talking to people about your

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.920
product, those customer conversations.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.320
That takes me to my last question here

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.640
is when I was thinking about bringing

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:18.320
you on the channel, I was thinking about

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:19.640
how WhisperFlow and all these other

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:21.320
companies that have raised tons of

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:23.000
money, it's kind of a quote crowded or

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:24.920
saturated market. Why do you think you

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:27.640
stand out or still successful?

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:30.960
>> So, I think something that Voicy taught

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:32.720
me is that within a crowded market, or

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:35.120
to be honest, within any market, It's

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:37.160
not the best product that wins. It's the

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:40.520
product that your customer sees first.

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:42.640
You just have one article that shows up

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:44.320
above your competitor. Even if your

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:46.440
competitor has a better product, most

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:48.960
