00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:50.720
Google or within the AI search and they

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:52.560
will try out your product. There's no

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:54.240
reason why you have to have the better

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:57.240
product. And the second part of it is

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:59.560
that like the market feels super crowded

00:11:57.240 --> 00:12:01.800
for people like you and me. But when we

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:03.520
go into the market that I'm serving,

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:04.920
these older folks, like they're not

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:07.080
